WEBVTT

00:05.350 --> 00:09.440
<b>I take it you are Kunai Maekawa,
founder of the Chuetsu-ryu.</b>

00:10.070 --> 00:12.570
<b>I would like to challenge you.</b>

00:15.030 --> 00:17.320
<b>I am Raijuta Isurugi!</b>

00:17.830 --> 00:21.080
<b>I am truly concerned
about the future of swordsmanship!</b>

00:25.120 --> 00:27.670
<b><i>Cloudy eyes
that I cannot see deeply into...</i></b>

00:28.000 --> 00:29.380
<b><i>but he is strong!</i></b>

00:36.800 --> 00:38.760
<b>What do you want from me, that you do?</b>

00:39.390 --> 00:42.430
<b>How do you think
swordsmanship should be today?</b>

00:42.930 --> 00:44.810
<b>Don't you think it is spineless?</b>

00:45.310 --> 00:47.690
<b>Don't you feel it is scant
and too delicate?</b>

00:48.480 --> 00:50.860
<b>My style is Shinko-ryu.</b>

00:50.860 --> 00:55.450
<b>I seek to fulfill the great deed of
restoring swordsmanship in its name.</b>

00:55.990 --> 01:01.580
<b>My desire is the eradication
of the over 500 swordsmanship styles.</b>

01:02.040 --> 01:03.040
<b>So I see.</b>

01:04.540 --> 01:08.670
<b>In that case, you and I don't get along
with each other, that we don't.</b>

01:09.960 --> 01:12.050
<b>You think nothing of it,
even if swordsmanship</b>

01:12.050 --> 01:14.010
<b>will fall to ruin
unless something is done?</b>

01:15.380 --> 01:17.800
<b>I am a swordsman myself,
even if not much of one.</b>

01:18.090 --> 01:20.720
<b>I do have feelings
of lamenting the future of swordsmanship.</b>

01:21.510 --> 01:25.310
<b>However, if the future is one
where murderous swords thrive,</b>

01:25.310 --> 01:26.850
<b>I would gladly decline.</b>

01:29.060 --> 01:30.440
<b>I see.</b>

01:30.980 --> 01:33.860
<b>So you are not in agreement
to my grand plan.</b>

01:35.690 --> 01:39.740
<b>Then, as of this moment, you are an enemy!</b>

03:17.960 --> 03:21.970
<b>EPISODE 16: THE IDEAL MAN</b>

03:32.980 --> 03:36.070
<b>This is the same technique you used
to break the floor at Maekawa Dojo.</b>

03:37.320 --> 03:39.320
<b>Secret Sword: Matoi-Izuna!</b>

03:39.820 --> 03:43.910
<b>This is a technique I revived
from a book of ancient sword art secrets!</b>

03:45.700 --> 03:47.830
<b><i>Amazing! As I expected of you, sir!</i></b>

03:48.580 --> 03:51.290
<b>You cannot win against me
by simply running away!</b>

03:57.630 --> 03:58.880
<b><i>A reverse-blade sword...</i></b>

04:00.340 --> 04:05.050
<b>As this sword shows, I have forbidden
myself from murderous swords.</b>

04:08.060 --> 04:12.730
<b>Now that I have deemed you an enemy,
I will make sure to crush you.</b>

04:21.990 --> 04:24.780
<b>For now, things have settled down.</b>

04:25.450 --> 04:26.410
<b>Let's go home.</b>

04:30.240 --> 04:31.120
<b>- Oh.
- Oh.</b>

04:31.950 --> 04:34.460
<b>I won't ever forgive you guys!</b>

04:34.920 --> 04:38.790
<b>Yeah, I get it. We're sorry,
so don't get so pissed, kiddo.</b>

04:38.790 --> 04:40.050
<b>Don't pat me like that!</b>

04:40.500 --> 04:43.340
<b>You gagged him and tied him to a tree?</b>

04:43.340 --> 04:45.010
<b>Sanosuke did it.</b>

04:45.970 --> 04:49.470
<b>You hear that? I'll make sure
to cut you with my secret technique!</b>

04:49.470 --> 04:51.560
<b>Shut up, already!</b>

04:51.680 --> 04:52.520
<b>What?</b>

04:53.100 --> 04:55.600
<b>If you got the energy to whine like that,</b>

04:55.600 --> 04:59.320
<b>don't just follow that big lug around,
and come to the dojo alone!</b>

04:59.650 --> 05:02.150
<b>If you do, I'll take you on!</b>

05:02.400 --> 05:04.490
<b>But with a bamboo sword!</b>

05:14.710 --> 05:16.620
<b>I came here like I promised!</b>

05:17.080 --> 05:20.130
<b>You know... what time do you think it is?</b>

05:20.460 --> 05:22.170
<b>You never set a time!</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.380
<b>Now challenge me!</b>

05:27.130 --> 05:28.510
<b>I'll settle the score with you!</b>

05:29.220 --> 05:30.260
<b>Brace yourself!</b>

05:31.720 --> 05:33.810
<b>Hey, Kaoru, can you be the ref?</b>

05:35.270 --> 05:37.060
<b>Then, first match.</b>

05:37.060 --> 05:38.650
<b>You got no spirit at all!</b>

05:38.650 --> 05:40.270
<b>I can't take on a challenge like that!</b>

05:40.520 --> 05:42.860
<b>Don't yell into my ear!</b>

05:42.860 --> 05:44.360
<b>You awake yet, ugly hag?</b>

05:44.360 --> 05:46.900
<b>I am! And did you
just call me ugly hag again?</b>

05:45.490 --> 05:46.900
<b>Challenge me!</b>

05:46.900 --> 05:48.490
<b>Listen up!</b>

05:46.900 --> 05:48.490
<b>- But you are an ugly hag!
- Huh?</b>

05:48.490 --> 05:50.950
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN-RYU</b>

05:49.950 --> 05:50.950
<b>First match!</b>

05:51.410 --> 05:52.660
<b>All right, bring it on!</b>

05:53.990 --> 05:54.830
<b>Oh?</b>

05:55.200 --> 05:56.040
<b>Oro?</b>

05:57.750 --> 06:00.840
<b>Aren't you holding the bamboo sword weird?</b>

06:01.790 --> 06:04.710
<b>Your right hand
should be above the left hand...</b>

06:05.210 --> 06:08.630
<b>and the left hand
should be gripping the end of the hilt.</b>

06:08.970 --> 06:12.680
<b>I-I only train on real swords!</b>

06:13.010 --> 06:15.180
<b>That's why I don't know
how to hold a bamboo sword—</b>

06:15.430 --> 06:19.190
<b>How you hold a real sword is no different
from a bamboo one, that it isn't.</b>

06:21.400 --> 06:26.280
<b>Is it possible that you've never
actually done any swordsmanship?</b>

06:27.440 --> 06:32.700
<b>I see. That's why you came
right when I woke up to get an easy win.</b>

06:33.030 --> 06:34.660
<b>There's no contest.</b>

06:37.160 --> 06:39.830
<b>Raijuta won't train with you?</b>

06:40.290 --> 06:46.170
<b>He can't help it.
He's busy trying to raise Shinko-ryu.</b>

06:46.880 --> 06:52.090
<b>He always says Shinko-ryu is a big thing
for Japanese swordsmanship.</b>

06:52.800 --> 06:55.890
<b>So I can't be selfish and get in his way.</b>

07:01.020 --> 07:02.610
<b>There's nothing you can do, I guess.</b>

07:02.610 --> 07:08.780
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN-RYU</b>

07:03.190 --> 07:07.570
<b>All right. Since you came all
the way here, I'll teach you for today.</b>

07:07.570 --> 07:08.780
<b>Huh?</b>

07:09.240 --> 07:11.700
<b>All right, first off,
how to hold a bamboo sword.</b>

07:12.070 --> 07:17.040
<b>You hook your left pinkie halfway
down the end of the hilt like this.</b>

07:18.040 --> 07:19.830
<b>Why are you turning all red?</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:21.040
<b>Sh-Shut up!</b>

07:21.210 --> 07:23.000
<b>Yahiko, stop jeering!</b>

07:23.500 --> 07:24.340
<b>Hmph!</b>

07:26.130 --> 07:29.880
<b>Face! Face! Face! Face!</b>

07:30.010 --> 07:30.840
<b>Face!</b>

07:31.180 --> 07:32.800
<b>That's right! That's the spirit!</b>

07:33.760 --> 07:35.300
<b>You're good, Yutaro.</b>

07:35.800 --> 07:36.810
<b>Really?</b>

07:36.970 --> 07:39.230
<b>Yes, really. You have potential.</b>

07:39.230 --> 07:40.560
<b>I'm so happy!</b>

07:41.600 --> 07:45.610
<b>A short break. Since nobody
has eaten anything this morning,</b>

07:45.610 --> 07:47.860
<b>I made some rice balls, that I did.</b>

07:48.190 --> 07:49.190
<b>Here, Yahiko.</b>

07:49.690 --> 07:50.690
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:51.950 --> 07:55.620
<b>Damn Kaoru. She's getting on his side.</b>

07:57.910 --> 07:59.290
<b>Here, Miss Kaoru.</b>

07:59.290 --> 08:00.120
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:02.330 --> 08:04.330
<b>Yahiko is pouting, that he is.</b>

08:04.580 --> 08:05.420
<b>Huh?</b>

08:07.380 --> 08:09.380
<b>Sheesh, he's such a kid.</b>

08:10.260 --> 08:11.470
<b>Yahiko!</b>

08:11.470 --> 08:12.680
<b>What is it, ugly hag?</b>

08:12.680 --> 08:13.930
<b>What?</b>

08:15.720 --> 08:17.180
<b>Here you go, Mr. Yutaro.</b>

08:18.180 --> 08:19.180
<b>I don't want any.</b>

08:20.390 --> 08:22.940
<b>Sir said you were his enemy.</b>

08:23.440 --> 08:25.520
<b>I won't accept any handouts from enemies.</b>

08:26.020 --> 08:28.020
<b>Don't be so stubborn, that you shouldn't.</b>

08:28.520 --> 08:32.030
<b>See, the old general,
Kenshin Uesugi, in the Sengoku Era</b>

08:32.030 --> 08:34.450
<b>was said to have given salt
to the enemy general.</b>

08:44.080 --> 08:45.580
<b>There we go.</b>

08:45.790 --> 08:48.540
<b>Oh, don't sit next to me without asking!</b>

08:49.420 --> 08:52.920
<b>How is it?
Is bamboo swordsmanship fun, that is?</b>

08:53.130 --> 08:57.510
<b>It's only play to begin with.
Any play is sure to be fun.</b>

09:00.600 --> 09:02.890
<b>But I can't become stronger
from just play.</b>

09:02.890 --> 09:03.730
<b>Oro?</b>

09:04.810 --> 09:10.360
<b>I want to become an invincible swordsman
like my mentor and put my father to shame.</b>

09:11.610 --> 09:14.320
<b>Put your father to shame, that is?</b>

09:14.820 --> 09:15.910
<b>Yes.</b>

09:16.360 --> 09:18.990
<b>He ditched the pride of being a samurai
to become a merchant.</b>

09:19.490 --> 09:22.330
<b>He's always got a fake smile,
bowing down left and right.</b>

09:22.700 --> 09:25.790
<b>Not only that, but he's working hard
on his business selling katanas,</b>

09:25.790 --> 09:28.290
<b>the soul of samurais, overseas.</b>

09:29.420 --> 09:36.090
<b>I want to pound into him how a true
samurai lives with nothing but his sword.</b>

09:36.550 --> 09:40.600
<b><i>He's just like Yahiko in having pride
of being a descendant of a samurai.</i></b>

09:41.310 --> 09:47.100
<b><i>However, the wish to become stronger
comes from a completely opposite place.</i></b>

09:48.690 --> 09:53.440
<b>Yutaro. If you don't mind, would you
like to train with us for a while?</b>

09:53.730 --> 09:54.570
<b>What?</b>

09:55.400 --> 09:59.160
<b>Let's put aside feelings of putting people
to shame or pounding into people.</b>

09:59.570 --> 10:03.410
<b>You have to face your feelings
of wanting to learn swordsmanship first.</b>

10:04.040 --> 10:07.580
<b>If you keep competing with Yahiko,
I'm sure you will become strong.</b>

10:08.420 --> 10:11.380
<b>I see. That might be a good idea,
that it may.</b>

10:11.880 --> 10:14.550
<b>Kenshin, Kaoru!
What are both of you thinking?</b>

10:14.550 --> 10:16.590
<b>He's Raijuta's apprentice!</b>

10:17.090 --> 10:18.550
<b>Heh. I get it.</b>

10:18.550 --> 10:19.390
<b>Huh?</b>

10:20.010 --> 10:23.890
<b>You must be afraid
of me getting stronger than you!</b>

10:24.140 --> 10:26.810
<b>Idiot! That's totally not the case!</b>

10:26.810 --> 10:28.940
<b>There's no way I'd lose against you!</b>

10:28.940 --> 10:30.020
<b>I hit the mark!</b>

10:31.480 --> 10:33.860
<b>You will start attending Kamiya Dojo?</b>

10:34.980 --> 10:36.400
<b>I beg of you!</b>

10:41.780 --> 10:43.030
<b>Well, that's fine.</b>

10:43.200 --> 10:45.830
<b>Oh? Thank you very much!</b>

10:46.330 --> 10:48.710
<b>They do say, "If you know the enemy
and know yourself,</b>

10:48.710 --> 10:50.920
<b>you need not fear the result
of a hundred battles."</b>

10:50.920 --> 10:52.500
<b>That's Sun Tzu's strategy!</b>

10:53.040 --> 10:55.300
<b>Go get some experience learning the enemy.</b>

10:55.460 --> 10:58.010
<b>Yes! Thank you very much!</b>

10:58.470 --> 11:01.640
<b>I have received
my first teaching from him!</b>

11:01.640 --> 11:03.390
<b>He has high hopes of me!</b>

11:09.980 --> 11:12.980
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

11:14.480 --> 11:17.940
<b>So that boy's been coming
to the dojo every day ever since?</b>

11:18.440 --> 11:19.990
<b>He's pretty passionate.</b>

11:20.200 --> 11:23.160
<b>Yeah. He has opened up to Yahiko, too,
that he has.</b>

11:24.410 --> 11:27.040
<b>Who you callin' a short monkey, cat eyes!</b>

11:27.160 --> 11:28.660
<b>In the first place, you were saying</b>

11:28.660 --> 11:30.660
<b>you weren't gonna train
in bamboo swordsmanship!</b>

11:30.790 --> 11:33.420
<b>Bamboo swordsmanship is just for play!</b>

11:33.420 --> 11:38.510
<b>I am here as a scout for my mentor's
upcoming battle with Kenshin Himura!</b>

11:38.710 --> 11:43.220
<b>Scouting? He usually only
helps out with the chores.</b>

11:43.220 --> 11:46.100
<b>Right. That surprised me, too,</b>

11:46.100 --> 11:48.970
<b>such a master of the arts
helping out with chores.</b>

11:48.970 --> 11:50.730
<b>Then stop coming here!</b>

11:50.730 --> 11:53.730
<b>Hmph! I don't recall
ever letting you boss me around!</b>

11:53.730 --> 11:55.560
<b>Opened up, you say.</b>

11:56.940 --> 11:59.030
<b>Okay, okay! Enough arguing!</b>

12:00.150 --> 12:01.740
<b>- Yahiko.
- Huh?</b>

12:01.950 --> 12:06.490
<b>Yuta is going to train the Jump-in Face
today, so can you be the target?</b>

12:06.740 --> 12:08.120
<b>Why me?</b>

12:08.120 --> 12:11.710
<b>I'm too tall compared to him,
so it won't be good training.</b>

12:11.910 --> 12:16.380
<b>Stop your grumbling, and put your mask on.
This is an order from the acting master!</b>

12:17.130 --> 12:18.380
<b>Damn it!</b>

12:19.460 --> 12:21.260
<b>Hurry on over.</b>

12:21.260 --> 12:24.680
<b>I'll take on your weak-ass sword,
so be grateful.</b>

12:26.890 --> 12:28.220
<b>Face!</b>

12:28.560 --> 12:29.520
<b>Oh...</b>

12:29.520 --> 12:30.680
<b>How is it?</b>

12:30.680 --> 12:32.180
<b>This is surprising.</b>

12:33.520 --> 12:37.520
<b><i>He may have more swordsmanship potential
than I had thought.</i></b>

12:38.230 --> 12:39.070
<b>Face!</b>

12:40.610 --> 12:44.860
<b><i>He was a total amateur that didn't
even know how to hold a bamboo sword.</i></b>

12:45.030 --> 12:47.660
<b><i>I didn't think he'd improve this much
in such a short time.</i></b>

12:47.660 --> 12:48.620
<b>Face!</b>

12:49.660 --> 12:51.910
<b><i>He's not all talk!</i></b>

12:52.250 --> 12:53.120
<b>Face!</b>

12:54.250 --> 12:55.080
<b><i>But...</i></b>

12:55.330 --> 12:58.590
<b>It really does piss me off if you
just keep pounding me for no reason!</b>

12:58.790 --> 13:01.210
<b>What was that? I'll take you on!</b>

13:01.210 --> 13:03.630
<b>- I'll make an attack, too!
- Bring it!</b>

13:01.920 --> 13:03.630
<b>That's enough!</b>

13:05.050 --> 13:06.260
<b>Ororo.</b>

13:07.510 --> 13:11.140
<b>BEEF HOT-POT AND SAKE
AKABEKO RESTAURANT</b>

13:11.350 --> 13:14.810
<b>Meals are really tasty after you exercise!</b>

13:15.270 --> 13:19.020
<b>Hey, server over there,
I'd like another helping!</b>

13:19.230 --> 13:21.360
<b>There's no rice here for you to eat!</b>

13:21.570 --> 13:24.240
<b>What was that? I'm a customer!</b>

13:24.240 --> 13:26.660
<b>Like I'd know!
I haven't acknowledged you as such!</b>

13:24.740 --> 13:26.660
<b>You're not stopping them, that you aren't?</b>

13:26.660 --> 13:28.240
<b>I don't care anymore.</b>

13:26.660 --> 13:29.950
<b>What a cheeky employee! I'll show you!</b>

13:28.240 --> 13:29.120
<b>Excuse me.</b>

13:29.950 --> 13:32.240
<b>What was that? Bring it on!</b>

13:30.280 --> 13:31.620
<b>Oh, Tsubame.</b>

13:32.240 --> 13:35.540
<b>Is that Yahiko's friend?</b>

13:32.240 --> 13:35.540
<b>I can take you on anytime!</b>

13:36.580 --> 13:38.580
<b>Well, yeah, something like that.</b>

13:39.080 --> 13:41.130
<b>They seem to be getting along really well.</b>

13:41.710 --> 13:44.470
<b>We're arguing! What part of this
is getting along well?</b>

13:44.470 --> 13:46.090
<b>You might as well be blind!</b>

13:46.090 --> 13:47.470
<b>I-I'm sorry.</b>

13:47.680 --> 13:51.100
<b>Yahiko! Don't scare Tsubame like that!</b>

13:51.760 --> 13:52.600
<b>H-H-Hold on.</b>

13:52.600 --> 13:55.060
<b>Please, use this.</b>

13:55.180 --> 13:57.020
<b>Yuta is so kind!</b>

13:57.350 --> 13:59.480
<b>Such a big difference
compared to a brat I know!</b>

14:01.820 --> 14:03.150
<b>Damn it.</b>

14:03.150 --> 14:04.110
<b>Hmph!</b>

14:05.950 --> 14:08.820
<b>Yuta, this is only
if you're okay with it...</b>

14:09.320 --> 14:10.320
<b>What is it?</b>

14:10.780 --> 14:13.290
<b>Why don't you become one of our students?</b>

14:14.700 --> 14:15.830
<b>How about it?</b>

14:15.830 --> 14:17.870
<b>I think you'd go pretty far.</b>

14:18.210 --> 14:19.790
<b>You can definitely become a swordsman</b>

14:19.790 --> 14:22.750
<b>carrying on
Kamiya Kasshin-ryu with Yahiko.</b>

14:25.380 --> 14:26.260
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:27.840 --> 14:30.140
<b>Miss Kaoru,
you're an excellent instructor...</b>

14:30.850 --> 14:34.350
<b>and I'm really glad you have
such high expectations for me.</b>

14:34.810 --> 14:39.770
<b>And I can tell that Kenshin Himura
really is a powerful swordsman.</b>

14:40.770 --> 14:43.020
<b>Though I hate bird head.</b>

14:43.020 --> 14:45.610
<b>I have no intent on being liked by you.</b>

14:46.740 --> 14:49.200
<b>I had made fun of bamboo swordsmanship,</b>

14:49.200 --> 14:51.660
<b>but it was really interesting
once I tried it out.</b>

14:51.660 --> 14:53.580
<b>Training at Kamiya Dojo really was fun.</b>

14:53.580 --> 14:58.210
<b>But if I'm gonna become stronger,
I really want that...</b>

14:59.210 --> 15:02.290
<b>under Mr. Raijuta.</b>

15:10.590 --> 15:12.550
<b>The first night I met him</b>

15:12.800 --> 15:15.060
<b>it was a night just like tonight.</b>

15:16.850 --> 15:18.730
<b>It was right in front
of that jizo statue.</b>

15:19.390 --> 15:21.480
<b>We were attacked by a horde of bandits.</b>

15:23.360 --> 15:24.190
<b>Old man!</b>

15:24.940 --> 15:28.190
<b>You can call for help, Mr. Tsukayama.</b>

15:29.070 --> 15:31.490
<b>Though, on the outskirts
of a town like this,</b>

15:31.490 --> 15:33.660
<b>I'm sure nobody will hear you.</b>

15:33.870 --> 15:34.870
<b>Damn it!</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:39.370
<b>I will give you as much money as you want!
So spare me my life!</b>

15:39.370 --> 15:40.330
<b>Dad!</b>

15:40.660 --> 15:42.630
<b>How pathetic.</b>

15:42.630 --> 15:44.880
<b>Did you turn the pride
of a samurai into money</b>

15:44.880 --> 15:47.300
<b>along with the sword on your belt?</b>

15:47.670 --> 15:50.930
<b>Hey, aren't you gonna grovel
and beg for your life, too?</b>

15:51.130 --> 15:54.090
<b>Give me a break!
I'm a Tokyo samurai,</b>

15:54.090 --> 15:54.970
<b>Yutaro Tsuk—</b>

15:55.470 --> 15:56.350
<b>Yutaro!</b>

15:57.310 --> 15:59.560
<b>Don't try to act cool, kid.</b>

15:59.560 --> 16:05.230
<b>Kids should be kids and mimic
what their parents do and grovel.</b>

16:05.730 --> 16:07.440
<b>Right, Mr. Tsukayama?</b>

16:07.440 --> 16:10.440
<b>Please! Anything but our lives!</b>

16:21.460 --> 16:22.920
<b>It was just one blow.</b>

16:23.790 --> 16:25.790
<b>That one blow ended everything.</b>

16:26.540 --> 16:30.420
<b>The bandits scattered about
in all directions and ran away.</b>

16:30.920 --> 16:33.220
<b>My mentor was truly invincible!</b>

16:34.300 --> 16:36.430
<b>I really felt it that night.</b>

16:38.760 --> 16:41.600
<b>Raijuta helping people out, huh?</b>

16:41.600 --> 16:44.020
<b>That sounds like a big, fat lie.</b>

16:44.020 --> 16:45.560
<b>Shut up, bird head!</b>

16:46.060 --> 16:49.900
<b>Everyone has misconceptions about him
because he doesn't talk or show emotions.</b>

16:51.070 --> 16:56.070
<b>That strength to rout everything else
in this world is my ideal.</b>

16:58.490 --> 17:00.830
<b>If I can become as strong as him,</b>

17:00.830 --> 17:04.330
<b>I wouldn't have to live
a pathetic life like my father.</b>

17:06.670 --> 17:07.670
<b>Kenshin Himura...</b>

17:08.790 --> 17:11.010
<b>you're going to fight him
at some point, right?</b>

17:11.710 --> 17:15.720
<b>When you do, fight him fair and square
in a straight battle.</b>

17:17.800 --> 17:18.640
<b>Understood.</b>

17:19.350 --> 17:21.060
<b>That's what a battle between two men is—</b>

17:26.770 --> 17:27.730
<b>Sir!</b>

17:31.070 --> 17:32.320
<b>Sir?</b>

17:32.860 --> 17:35.530
<b>An ambush from behind
on the streets at night, eh?</b>

17:35.860 --> 17:38.740
<b>Looks like that facade of yours
is finally coming off.</b>

17:38.740 --> 17:41.950
<b>You're wrong! That was just a greeting!</b>

17:41.950 --> 17:43.910
<b>He wasn't really serious
about that at all!</b>

17:44.290 --> 17:46.000
<b>Isn't that right, sir?</b>

17:47.880 --> 17:49.000
<b>Sir...</b>

17:51.420 --> 17:53.710
<b>Get away, Miss Kaoru, that you should.</b>

18:03.970 --> 18:07.020
<b>This is just like me with my Zanbato.</b>

18:07.480 --> 18:11.230
<b>No matter how much force it has,
it's useless if it doesn't connect.</b>

18:12.780 --> 18:13.650
<b>Blinding attack!</b>

18:13.650 --> 18:14.490
<b>That's dirty!</b>

18:14.490 --> 18:15.400
<b>Sir!</b>

18:17.070 --> 18:18.070
<b>That's not enough.</b>

18:19.160 --> 18:20.410
<b>Ryuutsuisen!</b>

18:31.630 --> 18:35.920
<b>Looks like I won't be able
to defeat you with Matoi-Izuna.</b>

18:39.390 --> 18:42.560
<b>This was the ace up my sleeve,
but I have no choice!</b>

18:45.140 --> 18:47.430
<b>Secret Sword: Tobi-Izuna!</b>

18:48.440 --> 18:49.310
<b><i>What the...</i></b>

18:57.110 --> 18:58.110
<b>Yutaro!</b>

18:59.820 --> 19:01.700
<b>Stop the bleeding!
Get him to a doctor quick!</b>

19:01.950 --> 19:04.700
<b>As long as it misses the vitals,
he won't die.</b>

19:07.160 --> 19:11.000
<b>You idiot! Your own attack
caused injury to your apprentice!</b>

19:11.380 --> 19:12.710
<b>Don't you get it?</b>

19:13.420 --> 19:17.800
<b>Did you think I'd seriously
take such a kid under my wing?</b>

19:18.050 --> 19:20.010
<b>What was that?</b>

19:20.470 --> 19:24.970
<b>You must be aware that swordsmanship
doesn't make money these days.</b>

19:25.560 --> 19:30.100
<b>However, in order to raise Shinko-ryu,
I need quite a sum as capital.</b>

19:30.640 --> 19:33.560
<b>That kid is the son of my investor,</b>

19:33.560 --> 19:37.610
<b>so I withstood his annoying nature
and pretended to be his master.</b>

19:38.190 --> 19:40.990
<b>It's a shame I'm going to lose
my investor at this point,</b>

19:40.990 --> 19:43.530
<b>especially since I staged a fake robbery
to get him.</b>

19:43.780 --> 19:47.040
<b>Oh, well, there are
plenty of replacements.</b>

19:47.660 --> 19:49.330
<b>Sir...</b>

19:50.040 --> 19:52.830
<b>Right now, the first thing on my agenda
is to defeat you.</b>

19:53.920 --> 19:54.880
<b>Here goes!</b>

19:54.880 --> 19:56.840
<b>You just wait there a while.</b>

19:58.090 --> 20:00.300
<b>I'm going to take Yutaro to a doctor.</b>

20:01.800 --> 20:03.930
<b>I will take you on once that's settled.</b>

20:07.010 --> 20:08.350
<b>All right.</b>

20:09.890 --> 20:11.890
<b>You're finally serious about this.</b>

20:12.600 --> 20:17.730
<b>Sheesh, this feather dude
doesn't realize what he actually did.</b>

20:18.190 --> 20:24.660
<b>You finally touched upon the wrath
of the scariest man in this world.</b>

20:27.660 --> 20:29.620
<b>OGUNI CLINIC</b>

20:30.500 --> 20:31.330
<b>Whew.</b>

20:32.250 --> 20:33.330
<b>Miss Megumi!</b>

20:33.870 --> 20:34.960
<b>How is Yuta?</b>

20:35.500 --> 20:38.250
<b>What in the world cut that boy?</b>

20:38.590 --> 20:43.380
<b>He has such a clean, open wound,
but very little bleeding.</b>

20:43.380 --> 20:45.220
<b>I've never seen anything like that before.</b>

20:45.430 --> 20:48.260
<b>I don't know much myself.</b>

20:48.260 --> 20:49.930
<b>Anyways, how is Yuta?</b>

20:49.930 --> 20:51.770
<b>His life is not threatened.</b>

20:53.770 --> 20:54.650
<b>However...</b>

20:55.860 --> 20:56.770
<b>However?</b>

20:57.110 --> 21:00.730
<b>The nerves and tendons are all slashed.</b>

21:01.320 --> 21:03.780
<b>I'm sorry to say, but that kid</b>

21:03.780 --> 21:06.700
<b>will never be able to perform
any swordsmanship again.</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.970
<b>NEXT EPISODE
SETTLING THE SCORE</b>

22:46.470 --> 22:48.760
<b><i>Next episode, "Settling the Score."</i></b>
